        "TileImage": "$($repository ca1e11d8-8a96-45f0-a70f-fcdc0a859888).Image",
        "Description": "In this contract mini-series I will be picking targets unique to each floor, so today we start with the lowest level, which includes mainly the parking garage, or for any Brits, &quot;the car park&quot;.\r\rJust one jabronie requires an accidental elimination, the rest, ehh its up to you and your intuition (which historically is lacking).\r\rBut the ICA will trust you once more with this contract. We hope you redeem us.\r\rBest of luck.",
